’t work, contact us."}},"comp-jkzw84n8":{"html":"<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">We were very fortunate&nbsp;to get some beautiful Sockeye Salmon this year. If you&#39;ve ever had Copper River Salmon or Kenai Red Sockeye you&#39;ll know what I&#39;m talking about. It&#39;s amazingly rich in color and omega 3&#39;s and absolutely delicious!</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">I love to pan sear these fillets just lightly seasoned in cast iron that&#39;s super hot. These fillets are fairly thin so it didn&#39;t take long just a few minutes per side.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">The pasta comes together very quickly as well so you can have this healthy and elegant dinner ready in under an hour.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">Cheers!</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">~Melisa</p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jkzw84o1":{"translations":{"title":"Widget Didn’t Load","text1":"Check your internet and refresh this page.","text2":"If that doesn’t work, contact us."}},"comp-jkzw84or":{},"comp-jkzw84pi":{"html":"<h5 class=\"font_5 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:40px;\"><span style=\"font-size:40px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:caudex,serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Sockeye Salmon </span></span></h5>\n\n<h5 class=\"font_5 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:40px;\"><span style=\"font-size:40px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:caudex,serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">and Pasta Zoodles</span></span></h5>\n\n<h5 class=\"font_5 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:caudex,serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">serves 2-3 with leftover pasta zoodles</span></span></h5>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jkzw84qc":{"html":"<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Ingredients</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">1&nbsp;salmon fillet&nbsp;1 to&nbsp;1 1/2 pounds</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">1 tablespoon,&nbsp;light in flavor,&nbsp;quality oil</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">1 spiralized zucchini</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.4em; font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">1/2 pound spaghetti</span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">1/4 cup real butter softened</span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">3 large cloves of garlic minced</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.4em; font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">the juice of half a lemon</span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">1/3 cup grated Parmesan&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.4em; font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">plus more for serving</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.4em; font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">1 1/2 tablespoons of your favorite all purpose seasoning - I used Konriko Greek Seasoning</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.4em; font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">salt &amp; pepper</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"line-height:1.4em; font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jkzw84re":{"pinUrl":"https://www.pinterest.com/pin/637329784744415166/","isConsentPolicyActive":false,"isMobile":false,"translations":{"componentName":"Share from Pinterest","large_element_one_cookie":"<%=componentname%> was blocked due to your <%=cookietype%> cookie settings. <url>Update your settings<url> ","large_element_two_cookie":"<%=componentname%> was blocked due to your <%=cookietype%> and <%=cookietype%> cookie settings. <url>Update your settings<url>","medium_element_one_cookie":"To view <%=componentname%>, <url>adjust your <%=cookietype%> cookie settings.<url>","medium_element_two_cookie":"To view <%=componentname%>, <url>adjust your <%=cookietype%> and <%=cookietype%> cookie settings.<url>","small_element_one_cookie":"<url>Update your cookie settings<url>","small_element_two_cookie":"<url>Update your cookie settings<url>","small_tooltip_one_cookie":"To view <%=componentname%>, update your <%=cookietype%> settings.","small_tooltip_two_cookie":"To view <%=componentname%>, update your <%=cookietype%> and <%=cookietype%> settings.","small_element_aria_label":"More info","tiny_element_one_cookie":"<%=componentname%> was blocked due to your <%=cookietype%> cookie settings. <url>Update your settings<url>","tiny_element_two_cookie":"<%=componentname%> was blocked due to your <%=cookietype%> and <%=cookietype%> cookie settings. <url>Update your settings<url>","tiny_element_aria_label":"Unblock <%=componentname%>","analytics":"analytics","functional":"functional","essential":"essential","advertising":"marketing"}},"comp-jkzw84sm":{"html":"<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Method</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">For the Pasta Zoodles</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">Start preheating a cast iron pan on low heat and a medium sized pot 1/2 full of water on high.</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">Sprinkle the all purpose seasoning and a good quality oil on both sides of the fish and set aside.</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">When the water comes to a boil, add a tablespoon of salt to the water and the 1/2 pound of dried spaghetti. Boil the pasta for about 7 minutes or until nearly done. Next add the spiralized zucchini and continue to boil for 2 minutes.</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">Remove the pasta zoodles from the heat, then reserve 3/4 cup pasta water from the pan. Now drain the pasta zoodles thoroughly and stir&nbsp;the butter, garlic&nbsp;and lemon juice into them in the pot as illustrated above.</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">Now add the grated Parmesan cheese and about half of the reserved pasta water stirring well to melt the Parmesan into the lemon butter sauce. Add the rest of the pasta water a little at a time until the sauce reaches a silky creamy texture. Add salt to taste if needed.</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">For the Salmon</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">As the pasta finishes, turn up the heat to medium high and&nbsp;get the cast iron pan really hot.</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">Sear the salmon skin side up for approximately 3 minutes then flip and sear 3&nbsp;minutes or until the salmon just barely begins to flake. Remove the pan from the heat and let the salmon rest 1-2&nbsp;minutes while you plate the pasta.</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">Serve the salmon fillets with the Pasta Zoodles and lemon wedges, passing extra Parmesan cheese and pepper at the table.</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jkzw84ti":{"id":"comp-jkzw84ti","appDefinitionId":"13016589-a9eb-424a-8a69-46cb05ce0b2c","widgetId":"130165ba-4eeb-4a87-3121-a3cf2a86d2ca","isAppInClientSpecMap":true,"isViewerMode":true,"isResponsive":false,"translations":{"preloaderOverlay":{"loading":"Loading"},"errorMessageOverlay":{"reloadText":"Refresh this page","oopsText":"App Didn't Load","installErrorText":"